{"Input schema doesn't enforce uniqueness constraint for guests array - relies solely on server-side filtering which can produce unexpected behavior": 0.6534318923950195, "No checks for booking status (past/cancelled) or capacity before adding guests - adding guests to cancelled or past bookings may result in inconsistent state, confusing behavior, and sending emails/ICS for past events": 0.9468055367469788, "No validation for seat limits (seatsPerTimeSlot) before adding guests, risking overbooking when event has limited seats": 0.9512543678283691, "Input schema doesn't enforce non-empty constraint for guests array - should use z.array(...).min(1) to fail fast with clear validation error": 0.7876477241516113, "Input schema has no maximum bound on number of emails in guests array - potential DoS vector and resource consumption risk when calling prisma.createMany with very large arrays": 0.7952596545219421}